  "description": "From [Sura's Place](https://www.mangaupdates.com/groups.html?id=4850):\n\nKoo Tae-Yang is an unofficially retired footballer after going through few tough ordeals in life. He had seemingly given up on professional football until approached by his former teammate who offered a chance for a restart in FC Dalin of Chinese Super League.\n\nAt 34 years old, there isn't much left in his career but it doesn't mean it has to end with a low key...\n\nOriginal Webcomic",
